Error [E2426]: Function value does not satisfy `fn() Never`.
  --> tests/ui/never_return_fn_value.jet:8:32
    |
  8 |     holder :: Holder{callback: returns}
    |                                ^^^^^^^
 Why: `fn() Never` promises the callable never completes, so a returning function has the wrong contract (D-NEVER2=B).
 Fix: Pass a function declared `Never`, or change the expected function type.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2426
